      ],
      "lines": [
        "1 use in 1 file of the public API that is deprecated in Nextcloud 34 to 35. The text of the tag names the replacement where it has one.",
        "  lib/Controller/ApiController.php:117 OCP\\App\\IAppManager::isInstalled(): deprecated since Nextcloud 32; Use either self::isEnabledForUser or self::isEnabledForAnyone"
      ]
